## ⚡ Quick Start

```bash
# Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/your-username/tic-tac-toe-react.git

# Navigate to folder
cd tic-tac-toe-react

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Start development server
npm run dev

# Build for production
npm run build
```

After running `npm run dev`, open:

```bash
http://localhost:5173/
```

---

## 📝 Technical Note

In the initial version of the project, there was a runtime error caused by incorrect naming in JSX and a wrong structure in the game components. The main issue was rendering an array instead of a React component, which was fixed and the project now runs correctly.

